==Korean==

===Etymology===
From [[이]] {{qualifier|i}}, "this" + [[것]] {{qualifier|geot}}, "thing"

===Pronunciation===
{{ko-pron/auto}}

===Pronoun===
{{ko-pos|pronoun}} {{qualifier|demonstrative}}

# [[this]]

====Usage notes====
이것 can contract to {{ko-l|이거}}. Thus, 이것[[은]] can contract to {{ko-l|이건}}, 이것[[이]] to {{ko-l|이게}}, 이것[[을]] to {{ko-l|이걸}}, and 이것[[으로]] to {{ko-l|이걸로}}.

